- The NVFP4 KV-cache port baked into the production image: tonyd2wild's port
  (GLM-5.2-NVFP4-KV-4x-DGX-Spark repo, port/), building on danielwoz's E2M1 store kernel
  (vllm-dspark-nvfp4). BTankut's glm-5.2-4x-dgx-spark 380K recipe provided the pinned-pool
  discipline and the external deep-prefill numbers that motivated our measurement.
  drowzeys independently built a parallel nvfp4-MLA KV implementation.
